Comment cloner le projet :
1- git clone
2- docker-compose up -d

3- cd pw_job_istic

4-a) docker exec -it symfony_app bash
4-b) composer install
5- php bin/console doctrine:migrations:migrate
6- php bin/console make:fixtures LangageFixtures
7- php bin/console doctrine:fixtures:load


----
Comment pusher son commande
- Etre sur sa branche
- git add .
- git commit -m "MESSAGE"
- git push 
- Demandez une pull request sur migrations
- ATTENTION NE JAMAIS MERGER
